SUMMARY:Making Animal Dioramas: Grades 1-3 at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:In this class\, students in grades 1-3 will have the opportunity to design and sculpt a final diorama based on an animal of their choosing! We will discuss environments for the animals and how we can communicate differences in setting through out projects. Students will be able to explore a wide variety of materials through their final creations including\, paint\, recycled materials and more. This is a studio based class with lots of guidance to start followed by one-on-one instruction. Expect to have lots creative freedom within the bounds of the assignment! \n\n\n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/making-animal-dioramas-grades-1-3-at-pcad/
LOCATION:Pennsylvania College of Art & Design – Center for Creative Exploration\, 204 North Prince Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
