SUMMARY:Character Design: Grades 4-6 at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:Join us in this one day workshop for students in grades 4-6 as we learn to develop and create our very own characters! We will be breaking down the process of how to start developing characters from start to finish including developing their backstory and persona. This is a studio based class with some guidance to start followed by one-on-one instruction. Expect lots of creative freedom within the bounds of the assignment! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/character-design-grades-4-6-at-pcad/
