SUMMARY:Ocean Explorers! Grades 1-3 at PCA&D
DESCRIPTION:This one-day workshop for students in grades 1-3 will be all about the ocean! We will create artwork using mixed media\, which means mixing art supplies! We will combine painting and collage materials with drawing opportunities. Everyone loves the beach\, so come and celebrate summertime! This is a studio based class with lots of guidance to start followed by one-on-one instruction. Expect to have lots of creative freedom within the bounds of the assignment! \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/ocean-explorers-grades-1-3-at-pcad/
