SUMMARY:Lancaster Mennonite School Summer Open House
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Mennonite School will be holding an Open House for grades PreK-12th July 9\, 2026 from 5:30 – 7PM\n\n Drop-in during that time for tours\, talk with teachers and administrators\, learn about unique programs and exciting offerings\, and experience the caring\, diverse community that represents the LM difference! Interested students\, parents and guardians grades PreK-12th are welcome to join us! \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
